Commercial general liability (CGL) product liability (e.g. food poisoning from restaurant) claims third party injury settle karti hai.

Crop Insurance (PMFBY) me yield data tehsil level pe girne par farmer ko account me direct claim settlement.

Weather-based crop insurance (WBCIS) rainfall deficit (barish na hone) ko satellite data se track karke automatic claim payout.

Cattle insurance / Livestock bima me tag (RFID) lagana mandatory kyu hai (fraud prevention during death claim)?

Kidnap and Ransom (K&R) insurance high net worth individuals (HNI) ke liye India me secretly kaise operate karta hai?

Art and Antiques insurance valuation: Agreed value policy vs Market value policy at the time of claim.

Aviation insurance: Drone (UAV) insurance for commercial weddings/surveys covering drone damage and third-party crash liability.

Fleet insurance policy (10+ trucks ki ek policy) me premium discount transport company ko kaise milta hai?

Car key loss cover (Key replacement) - Nayi gaadiyo ki smart keys (₹15,000) khone par lockset replace karne ka rider.

Loss of personal belongings in car (e.g. laptop chori ho gaya gadi ka shisha tod kar) motor policy me cover hota hai? (Specific add-on required).

