Rat bite damage ( चूहे ने गाड़ी की वायरिंग काट दी ) claim under comprehensive motor insurance policy cover hota hai?

Parking lot me khadi gadi par ped (tree) gir jaye, to "Act of God" me cover hoga ya nahi? (Yes, under comprehensive).

PUC (Pollution Under Control) certificate invalid hone par insurance claim deny kar sakte hain supreme court ke ruling ke according?

Gadi pani me doobne ke baad (flood) engine start karne (cranking) se hydro-static lock hota hai, ye driver negligence maan kar claim reject kyu hota hai?

Car modification (Alloy wheels, spoiler, wrap) insurance company ko declare karke extra premium (electrical/non-electrical accessories) bharna.

Mismatch in chassis/engine number in policy document aur actual RC: Typo error claim ke time kitna bada issue ban jata hai?

OD (Own Damage) aur TP (Third Party) policy alag-alag companies se le sakte hain (Jaise 3 saal TP bundled + 1 saal OD from another)?

Short term motor insurance (1 mahine ke liye) available hai ya minimum 1 saal ki policy leni hoti hai?

Duplicate insurance certificate download karne ka Parivahan / VAHAN portal or mParivahan app integration.

Uninsured driver (Bina insurance wali gadi) se accident hone par, apni OD policy se claim lene ke alawa police FIR karwana.

Surveyor bribe (Commission) issues: Surveyor gaadi total loss declare karne ke liye extra paise maange to insurance company vigilance cell.

Salvage retention: Total loss me main gaadi ka kabad apne paas rakhna chahta hu, to insurance company payout kam kaise karegi?

Garage repair warranty: Cashless network garage repairs pe 6-month warranty insurance company back karti hai?

Depreciation on paint job (usually 50% material, 0% labor) standard comprehensive policy formula.

E-Policy (Digital issuance): DigiLocker me padi PDF insurance document traffic police accept karne ke liye legally bound hai (IT Act).

"Compulsory Excess" vs "Imposed Excess": High risk driver (multiple claims) pe agle saal company imposed excess lagati hai.

Car insurance lapse hone par (break-in policy), inspection/photos (self-inspection via app) naya cover chalu karne ke liye mandatory.

Self-inspection app me purane dents aur scratches ki photo capture hoke unhe "Pre-existing damage" me endorsement mark kar diya jata hai.

Refund on cancellation of motor policy: Agar main gadi beech saal me bech du, aur naya buyer apna insurance khud le le, to pro-rata refund.

Trade certificate insurance (Showroom/Dealer plate) transit damage cover before permanent registration.

Motor Insurance pool (Declined Risk Pool) high loss commercial vehicles ko cover dene ke liye IRDAI mandated mechanism.

Title insurance (Real estate): Ghar kharidne par builder ka legal title defective nikle to financial loss bachaane wali RERA backed policy.

Wedding insurance: Barish, dange (riots), ya halwai (caterer) food poisoning hone par shadi cancel/postpone ka event coverage.

Prize indemnity insurance (e.g. Cricket me Hole-in-one ya half-court basketball shot marne pe 1 Crore prize) sponsor ka risk cover.

Credit insurance (Trade Credit): B2B business me agar buyer bankrupcty me chala jaye to supplier ka invoice amount insure hota hai.

Hull insurance (Ships/Boats) marine insurance cover for vessel machinery and structural damage at sea.

