Unit Linked Insurance Plan (ULIP) me investment aur insurance dono combine kaise kaam karte hain?

ULIP aur Mutual Fund (ELSS) me 80C tax saving ke ilawa Returns and Cost structure ka difference?

ULIP charges (Premium Allocation Charge, Policy Administration Charge) 1st year ke return ko negative kyu bana dete hain?

Mortality charge (Life cover ki cost) ULIP me NAV se units cancel karke har mahine deduct hoti hai?

Fund Management Charge (FMC) ULIP me max 1.35% cap (IRDAI rule) mutual fund expense ratio jaisa hota hai?

