Insurance Ombudsman ki limit ab 30 lakh se badha kar kitni kar di gayi hai disputes settle karne ke liye?

Ombudsman ka decision insurance company par legally binding hota hai, par customer uske baad bhi court (Consumer forum) ja sakta hai?

Consumer Protection Act 2019 ke under "Deficiency of Service" claim karke District Consumer Commission me medical insurance claim file karna.

Section 45 of Insurance Act (Indisputability Clause) 3 saal baad fraud/misstatement pe claim reject karne se company ko legally rokta hai.

