Principle of Contribution: Ek health hospitalization bill 2 alag-alag companies (e.g. HDFC and Star) me proportionally divide kaise hota hai?

Proximate Cause (Causa Proxima): Aag lagne se bhagdar machi aur chot lagi. Kya Fire insurance ya Accident policy proximate cause (Aag) ko consider karegi?

"Material Fact" concealment: Diabetes disclose na karna health insurance me material fact hide karna kyu mana jata hai?

Claim repudiation (rejection) letter me specific policy clause code mention karna IRDAI guidelines ke under zaroori hai.

Ex-gratia claim settlement: Jab legally claim deny hota hai, par company good faith/humanitarian ground pe 50% pay kar deti hai.

TPA (Third Party Administrator) ka license RBI deta hai ya IRDAI, aur inki authority claim reject karne ki hoti hai ya sirf recommend karne ki?

TPA network hospitals se discount (Package rates) negotiate karte hain (e.g. Cataract surgery max 30k), jisse customer bill kam ho.

Claim investigation: Early claims (pehle 2 saal me death) me investigator neighborhood, hospital, aur employer se secretly puchtach kyu karta hai?

Fraud ring detection: Ek hi agent ki sabhi policies me 2 saal baad deaths claim aana, data analytics fraud detect karta hai.

Fake hospital bill fraud: Dummy hospital/clinic bana kar cashless claim pass karwane wale rackets pe FIR.

Staged accident (Motor fraud): Puraani damage gadi ko intentionally thoka dikha kar claim lene ki koshish.

Non-disclosure of occupation hazards (e.g. working in a chemical plant) leading to life insurance claim repudiation.

Intentional self-injury (Attempted suicide) health insurance aur personal accident policy me strictly excluded kyu hota hai?

Criminal act exclusions: Drink and drive ya illegal race me death/injury hone pe koi insurance pay nahi karega.

War and Nuclear peril exclusions: Dange (riots) aur war (terrorist attack) me farak aur inka general insurance coverage.

Terrorism pool in India: Terror attacks (like 26/11) ke damages ko cover karne ke liye GIC Re dwara banaya gaya special fund.

Grace period (30 days for life) vs Revival period (usually 2 to 5 years). Revival period me medical test dobara kyu hota hai?

Lapsed policy me health insurance (break-in) ke baad renew karne pe waiting periods zero se wapas shuru kyu ho jate hain?

Health insurance portability me "No Claim Bonus" (NCB) ka amount naye insurer me transfer (add) to sum insured hota hai?

Standardization of Exclusions (IRDAI 2019): Sabhi health insurers ki policy wordings aur exclusion definitions ek jaisi mandatory kar di gayi.

"Proportionate Deduction" clause hatane wale policies/riders IRDAI standardized products me kyu popular ho rahe hain?

Cashless Everywhere (General Insurance Council initiative 2024): Non-network hospital me bhi cashless treatment approve karwane ka naya process.

Cashless approval 3 ghante (3 hours) aur discharge 3 ghante me process karna IRDAI ka naya master circular mandate.

100% cashless treatment (Zero deduction) ke liye standardized charges hospital bill mismatch issues TPA aur hospital ke beech.

Bima Vahak aur Bima Vistaar: Gram panchayat level pe standard micro-insurance bechne aur IRDAI penetration drive.

File and Use guideline: Insurance company naya product launch karne se pehle IRDAI se approval kaise leti hai?

"Use and File" system (Regulatory Sandbox): Innovative / experimental insurance products (e.g. pay-as-you-drive) fast track launch karna.

Solvency Margin Ratio (Min 1.5): Insurance company ke paas claim dene ke liye reserves (paisa) hain ya nahi, ye metric kaise check karein?

Claim settlement ratio (CSR) se better metric "Claim Repudiation Ratio" aur "Claim pending 30 days+" dekhna kyu zaroori hai?

Misselling by banks (Bancassurance fraud): FD banwane gaye senior citizen ko 5 lakh ka single premium ULIP chipka dena.

Audio-visual (Video) verification senior citizens ko life insurance bechne pe fraud rokne ke liye mandatory.

Freelook cancellation bank RMs purposefully delay karte hain 15 din tak taaki commission clawback na ho, escalate to Nodal officer.

"Policy churning": Agent ek policy surrender karwa ke nayi policy kharidwata hai taaki use first-year ka 35% commission dobara mile.

Twisting and Rebating: Insurance industry ke 2 sabse bade unethical practices IRDAI strictly punish karti hai.

Fake caller claim: "IRDAI se bol raha hu, aapki policy me 2 lakh fasa hai, tax jama karo release karne ke liye" (Common scam).

IRDAI kabhi directly customers ko call nahi karta ya funds hold nahi karta - public awareness campaign (Bima Bemisaal).

Motor Third Party (TP) premium rate har saal IRDAI centrally decide (fix) karti hai gaadi ki engine (CC) capacity ke base pe.

OD (Own Damage) premium company market competition ke hisab se freely discount (up to 80%) de sakti hai.

Surveyor license IRDAI issue karti hai (Independent loss assessors), inki report motor/fire claim settlement ka base hoti hai.

If surveyor's assessed loss is ₹50,000 but workshop bill is ₹70,000. Customer has to pay ₹20,000 out of pocket (depreciation + non-payable).

Challenging surveyor report: Hiring a second private surveyor or demanding a technical re-evaluation from insurer's head office.

Deductible vs Co-pay: Deductible (Flat amount ₹5000) jabki Co-pay (Percentage 20%) claim amount pe depend karta hai.

Unnamed patient fraud: Kis aur ki policy pe apne rishtedar ka cashless treatment karwana (Identity fraud) hospital nexus.

Pre-existing disease (PED) "Declared vs Undeclared" vs "Not known at the time of proposal". (e.g. Undiagnosed tumor discovered after 3 months).

Claim investigation me hospital ke 5 saal purane admission records OPD slips (indoor case papers) me hypertension mention tha = claim deny.

Medical confidentiality vs Insurance consent: Patient ka medical data insurance company CIBIL/Experian ki tarah health registry (IIB) me share karti hai.

Insurance Information Bureau (IIB): Motor aur Health claims ka centralized database fraud cross-checking ke liye.

Previous motor claims (NCB fraud): Nayi company me jhooth bol kar 50% NCB liya, IIB data se pakde jane par zero dep claim reject.

Transfer of health policy to legal heir primary member ki death ke baad (Family floater continuing for wife and kids).

Sub-limit exclusions: Cataract lens cost limit ₹30,000. Bill is ₹50,000. Will company pay ₹30k and I pay ₹20k, or will they apply proportionate deduction on OT charges too?

"Customary and reasonable charges": Agar room rent limit 1% hai (₹5000) par hospital VIP room ka charge ₹15000 le, to deduction kaise work karta hai.

TPA desk at hospital refusing cashless at 11 PM on Friday. Reimbursement route is the only option, will 100% bill be cleared later?

Policy wording ambiguity (Rule of Contra Proferentem): Agar contract ki bhasha unclear hai, to court hamesha customer (jo contract sign kar raha hai) ke favour me decision dega.

Insurable Interest: Main apne padosi ya dost ki life/car insure nahi kar sakta, blood relation ya financial interest mandatory (e.g. wife, employee, debtor).

Group Health Insurance (GMC) claims employer specific buffer fund (corporate buffer) se TPA approve kar deta hai chahe PED ho.

Corporate tail policy: Job chhodne ke baad existing maternity ya upcoming surgery ko cover rakhne ke liye extension premium bharna.

Micro-insurance specific ombudsman handling processes keeping poor/rural consumer vulnerabilities in mind.

Delay in claim settlement: Health insurance company has to pay 2% above bank rate as penalty if claim delayed beyond 30 days of last document.

Fire insurance claim me "Stock register" aur "GST returns" tally karwana mandatory kyu hai (aag me jala hua saaman prove karne ke liye).

Motor Total Loss claim me RC cancel (Registration certificate cancellation at RTO) karwana zaroori hai taaki gadi criminal use me resold na ho.

"Missing vehicle" (Theft claim) FIR close "Untraceable report" court stamp aane ke baad hi final insurance settlement milta hai (6+ months).

Key replacement claim lene se kya motor policy ka No Claim Bonus (NCB) zero ho jata hai? (Depends on specific rider terms).

Personal Accident cover (15 Lakh mandatory CPA) 1 saal ka lene ke baad multiple vehicles (2 car, 1 bike) drive karne pe valid hai (linked to driver, not car).

PA cover standalone policy me Permanent Partial Disability (PPD) - e.g. loss of one finger - claim 10% ya 5% of Sum insured kaise calculate hota hai.

Medical expenses rider in Personal Accident policy: Hospital bill aur Lumpsum accidental death/disability dono alag se cover.

Foreign travel insurance me flight delay (by 6 hours) pe food/hotel expenses (up to $50) reimburse karne ki receipt submission.

Travel policy "Pre-existing condition" emergency abroad (e.g. heart attack for a known BP patient) deny/cover rules based on life-threatening status.

Over-insurance vs Under-insurance: 1 Crore ki factory ko premium bachane ke liye 50 Lakh me insure kiya (Average clause penalty applied in claim).

"Condition of Average" formula: Loss = Actual Damage x (Sum Insured / Actual Value). If 50% under-insured, claim payout is halved.

Indemnity vs Benefit policy: Health insurance is indemnity (pays bill), Critical illness is benefit (pays lump sum regardless of bill).

Waiting period porting rules: 4 year PED waiting. Ported after 3 years. New company will only apply 1 year waiting for old diseases.

Enhancement of Sum Insured: Porting or renewing from 5L to 10L. The new 5L has fresh waiting periods of 2-4 years, old 5L is fully active.

Fraud by Third Party Administrators: TPA arbitrarily rejecting 20% claims to meet internal loss-ratio targets (IRDAI audits on TPA SLAs).

Co-payment above certain age vs Deductible at any age. Mathematical calculation of out-of-pocket for a ₹10 Lakh heart surgery.

Robotic surgery / CyberKnife / Stem cell therapy exclusions standard policies me abhi bhi kyu hain (Experimental treatments definition).

Daycare treatments list vs OPD: Chemo/Dialysis is Daycare (Covered), but general physician fever consultation is OPD (Not covered unless specific rider).

Blacklisting of Hospitals: Insurance companies fake claims wale hospitals ko un-empanel / blacklist kar deti hain, customer waha reimbursement bhi nahi le sakta.

IRDAI Master Circular 2024: De-listing of hospital lists transparency mandate on insurer websites to avoid customer harassment at 11th hour.

Post-mortem delay / autopsy waiver in Covid-19 or natural death, but strict enforcement in accidental term life death payouts.

Settlement of claims by non-life insurers using AI (Artificial Intelligence) damage assessment through car photos (Instant ₹20k payout without surveyor).

